{"id":1765787,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-08T15:18:30.690Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/atgAcOEtYxjgGLfSnBS3htqaoJ8.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1765787,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["MA"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"تحت مظلة السوق","overview":"It is a fragile lantern held against the fading dusk of Morocco’s souk day, illuminating the rhythms of a world on the verge of disappearance. Each frame gathers the murmurs of bargaining voices, the gestures of exchange, the silent codes of belonging, a choreography of survival etched into the fabric of the lower classes. The camera does not merely record; it listens, translating the pulse of the marketplace into a language of signs and silences. Here, sociology meets poetry, semiotics becomes song, and discourse itself breathes through the dust and laughter of the crowd. What might seem ordinary commerce becomes a ritual of identity, a fleeting constellation of cultural memory. The film is not only testimony but elegy, a vessel carrying the soul of a practice that may soon dissolve, yet lingers in the lens as a living archive of Moroccan society.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/2mXDS9UaDHwpo8YWP6HP5SGyv8r.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":6,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Arabic","iso_639_1":"ar","name":"العربية"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"Signs in the dust","title":"Under The Umbrella of Souk","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"images":{"backdrops":[{"aspect_ratio":1.778,"height":720,"iso_3166_1":null,"iso_639_1":null,"file_path":"/atgAcOEtYxjgGLfSnBS3htqaoJ8.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"width":1280}],"logos":[],"posters":[{"aspect_ratio":0.701,"height":1232,"iso_3166_1":"SA","iso_639_1":"ar","file_path":"/nW0vvNOQIWYLPJcZFDGdb6AQU3N.jpg","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1,"width":864},{"aspec